---
import Doc from '@layouts/Doc.astro';
import Container from '@components/Container.astro';
import Section from '@components/Section.astro';
import CodeBlock from '@components/CodeBlock.astro';
import DataTable from '@components/DataTable.astro';
---

<Doc title="OpenCode Plugin Projections" description="Understand the vstack projection system: published reports, schemas, and consumption by OpenChamber">
  <Section id="projections" gap="l" aria-labelledby="proj-title">
    <Container>
      <h1 id="proj-title">OpenCode Plugin Projections</h1>
      <p class="lead">Projections are read-only, versioned views of vstack workflow state published for visualization and external tooling.</p>

      <h2>Architecture</h2>
      <p>The projection system separates <strong>authoritative runtime records</strong> (owned by OpenCode plugin) from <strong>published read models</strong> (consumed by OpenChamber and other tools).</p>

      <div class="card" style="margin: var(--space-xl) 0; padding: var(--space-lg);">
        <h3>Data Flow</h3>
        <pre style="background: var(--code-background); padding: var(--space-md); border-radius: var(--radius); overflow-x: auto;">
┌─────────────────────┐     Projection Publisher     ┌─────────────────────┐
│  OpenCode Plugin    │ ──────────────────────────▶  │  .vstack/reports/   │
│  (Authoritative)    │   Every 3s / on change       │  (Projections v1)   │
└─────────────────────┘                              └──────────┬──────────┘
                                                                 │
                                                                 ▼
                                                      ┌─────────────────────┐
                                                      │  OpenChamber Panel  │
                                                      │  / Dashboard Page   │
                                                      │  (Read-only view)   │
                                                      └─────────────────────┘
        </pre>
      </div>

      <h2 style="margin-top: var(--space-2xl);">Projection Types</h2>

      <DataTable
        columns={[
          { key: 'name', header: 'Projection', sortable: true },
          { key: 'path', header: 'Path', sortable: false },
          { key: 'schema', header: 'Schema', sortable: false },
          { key: 'description', header: 'Description', sortable: false },
          { key: 'updated', header: 'Update Trigger', sortable: false },
        ]}
        data={[
          ['Manifest', '.vstack/manifest.json', 'manifest.json', 'Project identity and version', 'On project init / config change'],
          ['Dashboard Index', '.vstack/state/index.json', 'dashboard-index.json', 'Active deliveries summary', 'On delivery/task status change'],
          ['Delivery Report', '.vstack/reports/deliveries/{id}.json', 'delivery-detail-report.json', 'Full delivery with tasks, agents, evidence, reviews, decisions', 'On delivery update'],
          ['Activity Summary', '.vstack/reports/activity/{id}.json', 'activity-summary.json', 'Chronological activity timeline', 'On any workflow event'],
          ['Quality Summary', '.vstack/reports/quality/{id}.json', 'quality-summary.json', 'Check results + review findings', 'On check completion / review'],
          ['Memory Index', '.vstack/reports/memory-index.json', 'memory-index.json', 'Categorized memory entries', 'On memory write'],
        ]}
        emptyState={false}
      />

      <h2 style="margin-top: var(--space-2xl);">Schema Versioning</h2>
      <p>All projections use <strong>protocol v1</strong> schemas defined in the umbrella repository (<code>contracts/projections/v1/</code>). The <code>schemaVersion</code> field in each projection enables graceful degradation:</p>

      <CodeBlock code={`# Check supported schema version
cat .vstack/manifest.json | jq .schemaVersion

# OpenChamber only reads v1 projections
# Future v2 projections will be ignored by v1 consumers`} language="bash" showCopy={true} copyLabel="Copy" />

      <h2 style="margin-top: var(--space-2xl);">Projection Publisher</h2>
      <p>The publisher runs in the OpenCode plugin background and publishes projections:</p>

      <ul>
        <li><strong>Interval:</strong> Every 3 seconds (configurable via <code>VSTACK_PROJECTION_INTERVAL</code>)</li>
        <li><strong>Triggers:</strong> Also publishes immediately on delivery/task/evidence changes</li>
        <li><strong>Validation:</strong> Validates against JSON schemas before writing</li>
        <li><strong>Atomic writes:</strong> Uses temp file + rename for crash safety</li>
      </ul>

      <CodeBlock code={`# View publisher status
vstack_status --projections

# Force publish
vstack_projection publish --all`} language="bash" showCopy={true} copyLabel="Copy" />

      <h2 style="margin-top: var(--space-2xl);">Consuming Projections</h2>

      <h3>OpenChamber (Built-in)</h3>
      <p>OpenChamber's vstack extension automatically discovers and reads projections from <code>.vstack/reports/</code> and <code>.vstack/state/</code>. No configuration needed.</p>

      <h3>Custom Tooling</h3>
      <p>Projections are plain JSON files — consume them with any tool:</p>

      <CodeBlock code={`# List all delivery reports
ls .vstack/reports/deliveries/

# Query with jq
jq '.delivery.title' .vstack/reports/deliveries/dlv_*.json

# Get quality summary for a delivery
cat .vstack/reports/quality/dlv_abc123.json | jq '.checksPassed + "/" + .checksTotal'`} language="bash" showCopy={true} copyLabel="Copy" />

      <h3>Programmatic Access</h3>
      <p>Use the OpenCode plugin's projection loaders directly:</p>

      <CodeBlock code={`import { loadDeliveryReport, loadQualitySummary, loadActivityReport } from '@vipintom/vstack-opencode/dashboard/projections/loaders';

const report = await loadDeliveryReport(paths, 'dlv_abc123');
const quality = await loadQualitySummary(paths, 'dlv_abc123');
const activity = await loadActivityReport(paths, 'dlv_abc123');`} language="typescript" showCopy={true} copyLabel="Copy" />

      <h2 style="margin-top: var(--space-2xl);">Troubleshooting Projections</h2>

      <DataTable
        columns={[
          { key: 'issue', header: 'Issue', sortable: true },
          { key: 'cause', header: 'Likely Cause', sortable: false },
          { key: 'fix', header: 'Resolution', sortable: false },
        ]}
        data={[
          ['Projections not updating', 'Publisher not running', 'Check plugin loaded: vstack_status --tools'],
          ['Schema validation errors', 'Schema mismatch', 'Check .vstack/reports/*.json against contracts/projections/v1/'],
          ['Missing delivery report', 'Delivery never published', 'Run vstack_projection publish --delivery dlv_xxx'],
          ['Stale data in OpenChamber', 'Files permission denied', 'Grant files capability in OpenChamber Settings'],
          ['Empty reports directory', 'No deliveries created', 'Create a delivery: vstack_delivery create ...'],
        ]}
        emptyState={false}
      />
    </Container>
  </Section>
</Doc>